<hor. epod. 4.1>	Lupis et agnis quanta Sortito obtigit,
<hor. epod. 4.2>	tecum mihi discordia est,
<hor. epod. 4.3>	Hibericis peruste funibus latus
<hor. epod. 4.4>	et crura dura compede.
<hor. epod. 4.5>	licet superbus ambules pecunia,
<hor. epod. 4.6>	fortuna non mutat genus.
<hor. epod. 4.7>	videsne, sacram metiente te viam
<hor. epod. 4.8>	cum bis trium ulnarum toga,
<hor. epod. 4.9>	ut ora vertat huc et huc euntium
<hor. epod. 4.10>	liberrima indignatio?
<hor. epod. 4.11>	"sectus flagellis hic triumviralibus
<hor. epod. 4.12>	praeconis ad fastidium
<hor. epod. 4.13>	arat Falerni mille fundi iugera
<hor. epod. 4.14>	et Appiam mannis terit
<hor. epod. 4.15>	sedilibusque magnus in primis eques
<hor. epod. 4.16>	Othone contempto sedet.
<hor. epod. 4.17>	quid attinet tot ora navium gravi
<hor. epod. 4.18>	rostrata duci pondere
<hor. epod. 4.19>	contra latrones atque servilem manum
<hor. epod. 4.20>	hoc, hoc tribuno militum?"
